//! `gas/config/tc-m68k.c`. [`super::generic`] reads it, following
//! `tc-m68k.c`'s own reading of the `args` strings that
//! `include/opcode/m68k.h` documents.
//!
//! The ColdFire MAC and EMAC forms are left out; rsasm does not
//! implement them.

